  <name>Screen Lens</name>
  <summary>Record your screen or a chosen area as MP4 or GIF</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>LicenseRef-proprietary</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.sc_software_tools"><name>SC Software</name></developer>
  <description>
    <p>Record your screen, or a chosen area of it, as an MP4 video or an animated GIF, with optional microphone audio.</p>
    <p>Works on X11 directly and on Wayland through the desktop screen-sharing prompt. No watermark on recordings.</p>
    <p>Free to use; a one-time PRO licence (Gumroad) unlocks batch and advanced features. Files are processed locally.</p>
  </description>
